Here is the complete, production-ready implementation of the web application. It
combines:

1.  Authentication System: Sign-up (Username, Password, Phone, Occupation) and
    credential-matched Sign-in.
2.  Rapido-Style Journey Planner: Pickup and drop route selector with live route
    tracing.
3.  Route & Bus Matching Engine: Ensures every bus number and name is strictly
    tied to its specific route (like real train schedules) and shows a "NO BUS
    FOUND" alert for invalid routes.
4.  Crowded vs. Non-Crowded Preference: Displays live occupancy, free seats, and
    shortfall risk.
5.  TransitGuard AI Engine & Authority Dashboard: Complete mathematical
    implementation of UBD, SPM, RSFS, prediction risk formulas, simulated/live
    tagging, QR-code passenger report interface, and an interactive Intervention
    Simulator.

File: index.html

Save the code below as index.html and open it directly in any modern browser.

